    <string name="dialog_estimate_title">About estimated data saved</string>
    <string name="dialog_estimate_body">This number is an estimate, not a measurement. AdVault blocks requests at the DNS level, so the ad content is never downloaded and its real size is unknown.\n\nEstimate = blocked advertising and tracking requests × %1$s (the average payload configured in Settings › Data management).\n\nAll other statistics are counted from real DNS queries on this device.</string>
